"Applies to the player bar of every style. The live spectrum only moves for "
"audio hosted on this site. The waveform is drawn by wavesurfer.js in the "
"visitor's browser: the first time an episode is shown it downloads the whole "
"audio file once (audio on another site needs CORS), then the browser keeps "
"the waveform. Not drawn on phones, where the bar has no progress row."
msgstr ""
"Applies to the player bar of every style. The live spectrum only moves for "
"audio hosted on this site. The waveform is drawn by wavesurfer.js in the "
"visitor's browser: the first time an episode is shown it downloads the whole "
"audio file once (audio on another site needs CORS), then the browser keeps "
"the waveform. Not drawn on phones, where the bar has no progress row."

